Subject: [Basta-users] Serious bug with time changes in recapture probability
Message-ID: <5B2F2CD24AD2764D898AF5A7B9A2ABBF032FA75B@hermes.demogr.mpg.de>

Dear BaSTA users,

  We have just fixed a bug when using argument 'recaptTrans' to specify time changes in recapture probabilities. Unfortunately BaSTA 1.2 cannot handle this, so I recommend to install version 1.3. Currently it's in the process of being uploaded to CRAN, but you can install it from R-forge by typing in the console: 

    install.packages("BaSTA", repos="http://R-Forge.R-project.org")


   I hope this bug hasn't affected many of you. Best,

  Fernando

